00E322  2  48                 PHA                     ; push on stack
00E323  2  A5 C3              LDA   Bpntrl            ; get BASIC execute pointer low byte
00E325  2  48                 PHA                     ; push on stack
00E326  2  A5 88              LDA   Clineh            ; get current line high byte
00E328  2  48                 PHA                     ; push on stack
